            <image source="/images/2025_08_06_f7193d1cc61b1e2c50ebg-09.png">
              <shortdescription>The paraboloid z equals x squared over 2 plus y squared over 4, intersected with the plane z equals 2.</shortdescription>
              <description>
                <p>The paraboloid <m>z=\frac{x^2}{2}+\frac{y^2}{4}</m>, intersected with the plane <m>z=2</m>.</p>
              </description>
