            <image source="/images/2025_08_06_f7193d1cc61b1e2c50ebg-09-1.png">
              <shortdescription>The level curve obtained by intersecting z equals x squared over 2 plus y squared over 4 with the plane z equals 2.</shortdescription>
              <description>
                <p>The level curve obtained by intersecting <m>z=\frac{x^2}{2}+\frac{y^2}{4}</m> with the plane <m>z=2</m>.</p>
